!","abilities":["Leaves Carmine Steam at its location when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":600,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.2}},"hot_spring_wandering_slider":{"slug":"hot_spring_wandering_slider","name":"Hot Spring 'Wandering Slider'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Hot Spring 'Wandering Slider'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A fluffy critter that has found something nice from the surfskate shop, so fast that it comes and goes without a trace! Not even the swirling mud or gravel can hinder its slick skating skills!","abilities":["Invisible","Can stack with a Hot Spring 'Jolly Rascal' and leaves Carmine Steam on tiles it travels over after combining"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":900,"def":300,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.2}},"urban_tornado_trendsetter":{"slug":"urban_tornado_trendsetter","name":"Urban 'Tornado Trendsetter'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Urban 'Tornado Trendsetter'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A mass of fluffy critters fighting over cotton candy, and it's a little hard to tell where the fur ends and where the candyfloss begins. Instead of candyfloss they've only had a mouthful of sand, so now they're itching for a bite.","abilities":["Explodes on first attack, dealing AoE Arts damage and spawning Carmine Steam","Summons a Hot Spring 'Jolly Rascal' and Fashion Street 'Robust Heavy' upon dying"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":1250,"def":300,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"fashion_street_supernova_caster":{"slug":"fashion_street_supernova_caster","name":"Fashion Street 'Supernova Caster'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fashion Street 'Supernova Caster'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A fluffy critter that has found something nice from a mysterious divination shop that will make people who notice it 'see stars'! It has become even stronger due to the latest limited-edition magic hat on its head.","abilities":["Attacks 3 units simultaneously when in contact with Carmine Steam"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":550,"def":280,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.2}},"big_man":{"slug":"big_man","name":"'Big Man'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Big Man'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A humongous and somewhat slow-moving fluffy critter, its sturdiness possibly stems from never picking at its food. Some 'Little Fellas' will willingly be eaten, for this lets them ponder their thoughts—just what exactly is the difference between them and the volcano?","abilities":["Throws a Hot Spring 'Jolly Rascal' on first attack"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1500,"def":1500,"res":25,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"dolly_sovereign_of_sheep":{"slug":"dolly_sovereign_of_sheep","name":"Dolly, Sovereign of Sheep","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dolly, Sovereign of Sheep.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Sovereign of Sheep, traveling through the barrenlands and enjoying lava surfing. He sees everyone as equals, and is happy to leave their 'mark' on this great land. Now, it's time to have some fun with him!","abilities":["Unblockable; permanently in Low-Altitude Hovering","[Wool Barrier] Physical and Arts damage taken is significantly reduced when the Barrier is active. When Barrier value reaches 0, Dolly will lose his Barrier and fall, losing Low-Altitude Hovering and becoming disarmed.","Barrier value can be significantly reduced by Steam Soda Bottle explosions.","Dolly loses Barrier value when taking damage from Operators standing around a Decorative Geyser.","Airy Dolly","Prioritizes attacking ground units, and applies Carmine Steam on tiles the targets are on","[Elated Firebreathing] Locks onto a unit, and afterwards lets loose a vertical line of fire on that target's location from top to bottom, dealing Arts damage to all units on tiles in that column and generating Carmine Steam on the tiles","[Unintentional Explosion] Stops attacking to charge energy. After a period of time, ignites all Carmine Steam from right to left, dealing Arts and Burn to all targets in range","Frantic Dolly","Cannot attack, leaves Carmine Steam on tiles it travels over","Deals Arts damage and Burn to units he bumps into","Dolly no longer uses [Elated Firebreathing], and will only use [Unintentional Explosion] upon making landfall"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.35,"stats":{"hp":80000,"atk":1000,"def":900,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":7}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png"},"previewFile":"sl-s-5.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":10,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_122_stmpq","kind":"device","name":"Decorative Geyser","row":3},{"col":2,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_122_stmpq","kind":"device","name":"Decorative Geyser","row":3}],"playbackPaths":{"0":{"points":[[12,1],[11,1],[10,1],[9,1],[8,1],[7,1],[6,1],[5,1],[5,2],[4,2],[4,3],[4,4],[5,4],[5,5],[6,5],[7,5],[7,4],[8,4],[8,3],[8,2],[8,1],[9,1],[10,1],[11,1],[11,2],[11,3],[11,4],[11,5],[10,5],[9,5],[9,6],[8,6],[8,7]],"distances":